The corpus is entirely synthetic. It contains no real government documents,
no real agency records, and no personal data. Agency names, activity codes,
and figures were generated from a fixed lexicon with seed 20260815.

The files under data/raw/ are verbatim responses produced by third-party
commercial LLM services in August 2026. They are redistributed here for
verification. Their status under those services' terms is the redistributor's
responsibility to confirm before publication.
